<title>SINGAPORE: Abu Dhabi tenders to sell May 14-15 jet fuel.</title>
<headline>Abu Dhabi tenders to sell May 14-15 jet fuel.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Abu Dhabi National Oil Co (ADNOC) has issued a tender to buy 25,000 tonnes of jet fuel for May 14-15 lifting on a free-on-board basis, traders said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The tender closes on April 21.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (+65-870 3084)</p>
</text>
